  {
   "user": "Benjamin Isaac",
   "message": "the way i see it, we have a ramshackle bunch of interesting people here. ORI has always been the part of tpot which isn't in lockstep with the big funders - most of us feel to strongly, ideologically, to put up with bullshit. and so we don't get astroturfed as much as a lot of others. \n\nBut we're here, essentially, to talk about ideas. practical philosophy, for lack of a better word. maybe some startup adjacent-ness, but i got too career focused a few months ago and it killed the fun. basically we are here to have a capsule of the old fashioned internet style of interaction. I'll start with a question for the floor, because i suspect you all have good ideas (alsso channel will be opened if people talk enough)",
   "timestamp": "2026-11-21T05:23:43.614000+00:00",
   "channel": "general",
   "channel_id": "discord:1344300408893345866",
   "thread": null,
   "thread_id": null,
   "reply_to": "discord:1573449503674073211",
